Reference materials
-------------------

Branched contains no code, assets, textures, models, lang files, loot
tables or data files copied from the third-party mods it interoperates with.
It references their block, item and feature ids by name at runtime only.

Block, item, texture and feature identifiers named in this project remain the
property of their respective authors and are governed by their own licenses.
The audited upstream jars are not redistributed; see
docs/dependency-license-register.md for versions, SHA-256 digests and the
license declared by each archive.

Minecraft is a trademark of Mojang Synergies AB. This project is not affiliated
with or endorsed by Mojang or Microsoft.
